# Git branches

- Use short descriptive branch names (for example `engine-shim` or `pytest-fixtures`).
- Never create branches whose names start with `cursor/`.
- After a feature PR merges, delete the local branch and prune stale remote-tracking refs (`git branch -d <branch>`; `git fetch --prune`).
